flowchart TD
    A[SplitOS Update Channel] --> B[Signed Release Envelope]
    B --> C[Eligibility Check]
    C --> D{Windows servicing / reboot conflict?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Defer SplitOS apply]
    D -- No --> F[Download + Verify Artifacts]
    F --> G[Stage Target Release]
    G --> H[Create Previous Release Capsule]
    H --> I{Capsule verified?}
    I -- No --> J[Abort update\nCurrent release remains canonical]
    I -- Yes --> K[Acquire UPDATE Mutation Lease]
    K --> L[Privileged Update Bootstrap]
    L --> M[Activate Target Release]
    M --> N{Reboot required?}
    N -- Yes --> O[Persist AWAITING_REBOOT]
    O --> P[Reboot]
    P --> Q[Resume Transaction]
    N -- No --> Q
    Q --> R[Verify Target Broker / Runtime / DB / Compatibility]
    R --> S{Mandatory predicates pass?}
    S -- No --> T[Rollback / Recovery]
    T --> U[Verify Previous Release]
    S -- Yes --> V[Atomic InstalledRelease Commit]
    V --> W[COMPLETED\nKeep previous capsule]
